Peripheral Battery Lite portable mode

This marker is intentional. When it exists beside PeripheralBatteryLite.exe
and PeripheralBatteryLite.Probe.exe, the application reads and writes
settings.json and battery-cache.json in the same folder.

Remove this marker only if you intentionally want to use the older
%LOCALAPPDATA%\PeripheralBatteryLite path. Do not move or delete
existing JSON files without making a backup.
